{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short psychological horror experience inspired by folklore. After a simple gathering at a friend\u2019s house, you soon realize the night hides something watching you from the shadows. What begins as an ordinary evening turns into a chilling tale where your decisions determine the ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in first-person for full immersion or with fixed cameras for a tense, cinematic experience. Explore the environment, uncover story details, and make choices that lead to multiple outcomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable in <strong>first-person</strong> or with <strong>fixed-camera perspectives</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric story inspired by Guaran\u00ed mythology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, narrative-driven horror with high replay value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design that amplifies the fear.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3797670?t=1761582720","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3797670?t=1761582720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797670/8a61f30c07e818c88cf1cd13820d5d0e8bdd6609/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761582720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797670/8a61f30c07e818c88cf1cd13820d5d0e8bdd6609/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761582720","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descript